{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "02ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$p : \\mathcal{X} \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$F$", "MATH_0006": "$S$", "MATH_0007": "$j : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{S}_F$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-representable-by-algebraic-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:51c0ee37633d6427d16e3c5271d4a9240de9b056145250208cad08b8dcc2f3d9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:414c43e90498d786a71546c8ae62663684e48965b1dbb5a074dba02f127723fa", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nA category fibred in groupoids <MATH_0003>\nis called <TEXTITOPEN_0001>representable by an algebraic space over <MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif there exists an algebraic space <MATH_0005> over <MATH_0006> and an equivalence\n<MATH_0007>\nof categories over <MATH_0008>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ec0e1468487cd244929908ccbb8ae71f14cce1f0c94f76d4b5b3fecad74c9b48", "unit_id": "tag:04SV:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "02ZV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$j$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-characterize-representable-fibred-category}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:00ceaf0c8188c206c95a07f10abf0ca2d8b472293e88b0db6a150a694e37cce9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8a6b7d19a933e21aa499de372e3ade9843c1e255af33c12977619c4c41e3bc92", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe continue our abuse of notation in suppressing the equivalence <MATH_0001>\nwhenever we encounter such a situation.\nIt follows formally from the above that if <MATH_0002> is\nrepresentable (by a scheme), then it is representable by an\nalgebraic space. Here is the analogue of\nCategories,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6e7ad9b7b35777f422da2fceec57c91fa68d0b328f6abc10d691294aae31782d", "unit_id": "tag:02ZV:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02ZV", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$p : \\mathcal{X} \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0007": "$U \\mapsto \\Ob(\\mathcal{X}_U)/\\!\\!\\cong$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-definition-category-fibred-setoids}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-representable-by-space}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:daa1b6f89a7f504ff6e01b6b369b7bbf418be041d9658fb588ea00922df5e6cf", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:669af94aee469b43ecbc976a6e6c24a727ea55164be04ac51a8359f1328156c8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe a category fibred in groupoids.\nThen <MATH_0004> is representable by an algebraic space over <MATH_0005>\nif and only if the following conditions are satisfied:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0006> is fibred in setoids<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This means that\nit is fibred in groupoids and objects in the fibre categories\nhave no nontrivial automorphisms, see Categories,\nDefinition <REF_0001>.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>, and\n<STRUCT_0003> the presheaf <MATH_0007> is\nan algebraic space.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:98dc7587f0b5f16bd30bc25edf05f81360ea6a838b1a527cb8d794a8c6c68054", "unit_id": "tag:02ZX:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02ZV", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-lemma-characterize-representable-fibred-category}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:94e6688a82113d9f8421a207b9ec58ebe234b8fa801fd1c42a9eaffaafb9a171", "source_text": "Omitted, but see Categories,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2164cb2a9d42eb99d6fe973c12369fea660460f38dba6cbe042f43aafe7d70cc", "unit_id": "tag:02ZX:proof"}
